  "currentWritePolicy": "B048 server-first: Window3 admits deterministic solver-clearable Neon deals containing the fixed ace of hearts (card 13) among the 30 board cards. Any chain ending on that ace followed by a draw unlocks, including an automatic bank immediately after the ace; an intervening board play clears the replay-derived pending latch. No proof/latch fields added. Window1 and Window2 retain exact generation, trigger rules and seed domains. Seven historical authorities remain byte-exact; current Classic remains level-v3, clear-v2 Classic writes reject UPDATE_GAME_REQUIRED; Daily/Warp clear-v2 unchanged. Row version remains 6.23. NO migration or SQL reapply, no database execution."
